  "goodToKnow": "Die Ordnungswidrigkeit is an administrative or regulatory offence, less serious than a Straftat (crime): Falschparken, zu schnell fahren, Lärmbelästigung. It's punished with a Bußgeld (fine), not a criminal record, and serious traffic offences also bring Punkte in Flensburg. The abbreviation is OWi. Widrig means contrary. Plural: die Ordnungswidrigkeiten."
